  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/lambda-invocation (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime and executes a bundled 727KB heavily-obfuscated script (math_init.js) at install time. The package ships clean library code for its stated purpose (an AWS Lambda invocation client) alongside this obfuscated install-time payload, which is executed automatically on npm install. The obfuscated payload uses a custom string-array decoder and is not readable statically; installing the package runs it without user interaction.",
